  75+ 6F28 DD 21 BB E9      ld   ix, flags
  76+ 6F2C DD CB 00 46      bit  $00, (ix)
  77+ 6F30 C8               ret  z
  78+ 6F31
  79+ 6F31 DD CB 00 86      res  $00, (ix)
  80+ 6F35
  81+ 6F35 ED 4B B3 E9      ld   bc, (PlayerPos)
